Genoed L;h after I almost got whacked to them several times, I'm a huge
pussy

12 wishes used from the wand I found + castle wand + many thrones and
IIRC a water demon (5% chance )

I was way more secure in what I was doing in this game compared to my
first one, so I played it mostly safe. Did some alchemy and nurse geno
to get high hp, got -12 AC from donations. Found one or two bonesfiles
from my previous unlucky characters, nothing too major IIRC. Poly'ed
into a xorn to eat some rings for intrisics.

Decided to try out displacement because it's just cool, and it worked
excellently. I also ditched my amu of life saving and shield of
reflection to #twoweapon with a amu of reflection, and I did sick damage
that way, but it was a bit scary. With the shield I'd have -50 AC? I'd
probably do a LOT less damage though.

##MC instead of ### was definately noticable, lost levels to undead a
few times, but usually got it back right after. Geno of L was probably
smart though.

(real life) fatigue struck me in the end, because I suddenly discovered
that I had misplaced my +7 silver sabre, with no clue whatsoever where
it went. Things got worse quickly though

Entering the astral plane, I wished up a +3 blessed fixed silver sabre
and wrote some enchant weapon. Not having enchanted in a loong while,
and being a stupid retard, I accidentally enchanted my +7 grawswandir
instead

I had to wish for a +2 blessed fixed fire brand to replace it, and soon
I was happily #twoweaponing away again. I used wand of death to get rid
of rodney and the riders, worked out nicely.

Overall a pretty fun game, it definately teached me that you can play
this game without spells for everything. I breezed through the last
part, the only time I was below 400 hp was when being pummeled by some
air elementals, but even they did little damage.

If you're stuck playing a single class, try a new one, it's often a very
different way of playing the game.

Man, nothing beats realizing you're standing on your own altar, amulet
in hand, knowing your epic tale is over..

I'm spent.
